@anon.0de5ee8f4a9046f07397637c35d34c13.1856 = private unnamed_addr constant [443 x i8] c"## What it does\0AChecks for commented-out Python code.\0A\0A## Why is this bad?\0ACommented-out code is dead code, and is often included inadvertently.\0AIt should be removed.\0A\0A## Known problems\0AProne to false positives when checking comments that resemble Python code,\0Abut are not actually Python code ([#4845]).\0A\0A## Example\0A```python\0A# print(\22Hello, world!\22)\0A```\0A\0A## Options\0A- `lint.task-tags`\0A\0A[#4845]: https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff/issues/4845\0A", align 1
