@anon.0de5ee8f4a9046f07397637c35d34c13.2223 = private unnamed_addr constant [462 x i8] c"## What it does\0AChecks for `noqa` directives that use redirected rule codes.\0A\0A## Why is this bad?\0AWhen one of Ruff's rule codes has been redirected, the implication is that the rule has\0Abeen deprecated in favor of another rule or code. To keep your codebase\0Aconsistent and up-to-date, prefer the canonical rule code over the deprecated\0Acode.\0A\0A## Example\0A```python\0Ax = eval(command)  # noqa: PGH001\0A```\0A\0AUse instead:\0A```python\0Ax = eval(command)  # noqa: S307\0A```\0A", align 1
